1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,420
B.A. pass hoon, phir bhi berozgaar. Ab kya karun?

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:07,894
Arre Raju, poora desh chai pe chalta hai. Chai ki tapri khol!

3
00:00:08,194 --> 00:00:11,026
Chai bechkar koi ameer banta hai kya, Chacha?

4
00:00:11,326 --> 00:00:16,145
Shuruaat 20 hazaar mein. Thela, gas, bartan, aur achhi chai patti.

5
00:00:16,445 --> 00:00:21,855
College, office ya hospital ke bahar lagana. Wahan bheed kabhi khatam nahi hoti.

6
00:00:22,405 --> 00:00:24,392
Bhaiya, ek cutting chai aur do biscuit!

7
00:00:24,692 --> 00:00:28,177
Ye lo madam, adrak wali special. Sirf 15 rupaye.

8
00:00:28,477 --> 00:00:33,533
Din ke 200 cup, yaani lagbhag ₹1,500 roz ka munafa.

9
00:00:33,833 --> 00:00:39,387
Saath mein samosa, biscuit aur bun-maska rakho. Chai se zyada unme kamai hai.

10
00:00:39,687 --> 00:00:42,646
Mahine ke 40 hazaar! Raju ki life set!
